
# BrainScan AI

Interactive medical imaging and machine learning dashboard.

## Project goals
- Build an interactive web application.
- Explore brain MRI datasets.
- Compare machine learning models.
- Visualize predictions and model performance.
- Deploy the website using Vercel.

## Technologies
Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Python, and scikit-learn.

## Status
Under development.

Educational project only. Not intended for medical diagnosis.

